---
/*
 * The three-person team + 90/10 split.
 *
 * Ports v1's Layer 02. FDE, QA, TPM. AI generates against a constrained
 * framework; 10% expert humans solve the edges. The codebase-composition
 * visualization (dark card with AI / Human bars + 90/10 percentages)
 * stays the way it was.
 */
---

<section class="team" id="team">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="s-head">
      <div class="left">
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>The team that ships it</span>
        <h2>90% AI. <em>10% expert humans.</em><br />The 10% is the point.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="right">
        <p>You don't need to care about this to buy from us — but it's the reason a three-person team can ship what fifteen used to. We spent about two years building a constrained framework before we shipped to a customer. AI generates code against the framework. Humans solve the edges.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="eng-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eng-points">
          <div class="pt">
            <div class="ic">FW</div>
            <div>
              <b>A constrained framework, not free-text codegen.</b>
              <p>AI generates against a controlled vocabulary of patterns. That's what keeps it consistent, maintainable, and predictable across customers.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pt">
            <div class="ic">3p</div>
            <div>
              <b>Three people. FDE, QA, TPM.</b>
              <p>AI handles the project board, the daily Slack updates, the tickets. The three humans spend their time on judgment, not coordination.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pt">
            <div class="ic">10</div>
            <div>
              <b>The 10% is where the hard problems live.</b>
              <p>Data migrations. Gnarly integrations. The compliance edge case the regulator will ask about. That's where humans earn their place.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="roles">
          <div class="role">
            <span class="r-key">FDE</span>
            <span class="r-name">Forward-Deployed Engineer</span>
            <span class="r-job">Owns the build. Lives in your stack.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="role">
            <span class="r-key">QA</span>
            <span class="r-name">Quality & Reliability</span>
            <span class="r-job">Drives test coverage, regressions, HITL gates.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="role">
            <span class="r-key">TPM</span>
            <span class="r-name">Technical PM</span>
            <span class="r-job">Single throat to choke. Talks to your sponsor.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="codeviz">
        <div class="bar">
          <span class="label">Codebase composition</span>
          <span class="legend">
            <span><i style="background:var(--color-indigo-500)"></i>AI</span>
            <span><i style="background:#fff"></i>Human</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="lines">
          <div class="line" style="width:96%"></div>
          <div class="line" style="width:88%"></div>
          <div class="line h" style="width:24%"></div>
          <div class="line" style="width:92%"></div>
          <div class="line" style="width:80%"></div>
          <div class="line" style="width:97%"></div>
          <div class="line h" style="width:18%"></div>
          <div class="line" style="width:74%"></div>
          <div class="line" style="width:90%"></div>
          <div class="line h" style="width:12%"></div>
          <div class="line" style="width:84%"></div>
          <div class="line" style="width:95%"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="pct">
          <div class="col ai">
            <b>90%</b>
            <span class="lab">AI-generated against framework</span>
          </div>
          <div class="col hu">
            <b>10%</b>
            <span class="lab">Expert-human · the edges</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .team {
    padding: 120px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
  }

  .s-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 80px;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 920px) {
    .s-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }
  .s-head .left .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 14px; display: block; }
  .s-head .left h2 { margin-top: 18px; }
  .s-head .left h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
  }
  .s-head .right p {
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    font-size: 18px;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .eng-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .eng-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
  }

  .eng-points {
    display: grid;
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .eng-points .pt {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
  }
  .eng-points .pt:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .eng-points .pt .ic {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--color-indigo-100);
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .eng-points .pt b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 18px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .eng-points .pt p {
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  /* ── Three roles strip ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .roles {
    margin-top: 28px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .roles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .role {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .role .r-key {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
  }
  .role .r-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .role .r-job {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  /* ── Codebase composition viz ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .codeviz {
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 32px;
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .codeviz .bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .codeviz .bar .label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .codeviz .bar .legend {
    display: flex;
    gap: 18px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }
  .codeviz .bar .legend i {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-right: 6px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .codeviz .lines {
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .codeviz .line {
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--color-indigo-600);
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .codeviz .line.h { background: #fff; }
  .codeviz .pct {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: end;
    margin-top: 28px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  .codeviz .pct .col b {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 48px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    display: block;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .codeviz .pct .col .lab {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: 8px;
    display: block;
  }
  .codeviz .pct .col.ai b { color: var(--color-indigo-500); }
  .codeviz .pct .col.hu b { color: #fff; }
</style>
